1
00:00:52,720 --> 00:01:10,380
I must bring you back, and save you from the fire.

2
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,760
Shan Cha!

3
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:22,960
Shan Cha! Shan Cha!

4
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,940
I don't want to die.

5
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,380
I believe in you.

6
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:30,440
I must avenge you.

7
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:59,440
This is the end of you.

8
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:45,320
The end of you.

9
00:03:54,340 --> 00:03:55,720
His name is Jin Da Xiong.

10
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,560
He is the reincarnation of the star of the universe.

11
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:00,440
He is very powerful.

12
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:08,620
You should know that your cousin is about to disappear.

13
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:12,840
I won't hide from him.

14
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:50,280
You should know that the most powerful killing dog in the world

15
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,780
is the star of the universe.

16
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:59,920
Cousin Li!

17
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,480
Cousin Li!

18
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:06,800
Cousin Li!

19
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:17,320
You have been hit by the star of the universe.

20
00:05:18,020 --> 00:05:19,820
Although you are not hurt,

21
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,720
you must possess a kind of divine power

22
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,120
in order to defeat the demon.

23
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:28,780
I will give you the power of the seven stars.

24
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:34,000
You must step on the seven stars and enter the forest.

25
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:39,340
Now you must focus on the seven stars.

26
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:43,480
The power of the seven stars will enter your body.

27
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:39,600
Shan Cha! I can't avenge you.

28
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:41,720
I can't kill Cousin Li.

29
00:06:46,130 --> 00:06:47,550
Shan Cha!

30
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,410
You used to be very brave.

31
00:06:53,130 --> 00:06:55,070
I couldn't get you.

32
00:06:56,070 --> 00:07:00,110
I didn't expect that I would get you.

33
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:03,310
You have become like this.

34
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:06,290
Shan Cha!

35
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:12,310
Shan Cha!

36
00:07:13,490 --> 00:07:15,610
If you want to die, die with me.

37
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,340
I will die with you.

38
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,940
Don't waste your life so easily.

39
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:42,120
Who are you?

40
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:45,900
Why did you stop me from killing myself?

41
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:51,120
I am Shan Cha's brother, Jin Da Xiong.

42
00:07:59,100 --> 00:08:01,380
My brother needs your care.

43
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:04,600
So you can't die yet.

44
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,440
I hate that I can't save him.

45
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:12,890
I don't want to live anymore.

46
00:08:14,710 --> 00:08:16,370
I will save him.

47
00:08:18,130 --> 00:08:21,290
But I need to change a living person's heart.

48
00:08:22,530 --> 00:08:23,890
A living person's heart?

49
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,290
Yes, a heart surgery.

50
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:31,030
If he changes to a man's heart,

51
00:08:31,330 --> 00:08:34,150
what if he ignores me like he used to?

52
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:38,070
I will go and get Cousin Li's girlfriend's heart.

53
00:08:38,370 --> 00:08:40,390
Cousin Li!

54
00:08:41,410 --> 00:08:42,070
What is it?

55
00:08:42,070 --> 00:08:45,230
I want to tell you that Cousin Li is in danger.

56
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:47,070
Come up here.

57
00:08:47,110 --> 00:08:49,090
I can't. You come down here.

58
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,840
Cousin Li, he's out to catch someone.

59
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:06,400
He's out to catch his sister's heart.

60
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:08,720
He's just a tyrant. Why are you afraid of him?

61
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,720
You're right.

62
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,660
But you're so good at martial arts.

63
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:13,560
Aren't you proud of yourself?

64
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,860
What martial arts do you want to learn? Tell me.

65
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,760
I want to learn something that can change.

66
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,800
I want to learn the invisible technique.

67
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:22,440
Okay, pay attention.

68
00:09:38,570 --> 00:09:39,970
Stand up.

69
00:09:40,010 --> 00:09:42,730
Stand up.

70
00:09:44,230 --> 00:09:46,110
Okay, watch my performance.

71
00:09:52,470 --> 00:09:53,350
I've changed.

72
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,320
I've changed.

73
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,860
How can you do this to a child?

74
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:34,920
I just want to tell him that the invisible technique

75
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,640
can't make a mistake.

76
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,540
You're not going to tell me what's wrong?

77
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:51,190
He's too young. What martial arts do you want to teach him?

78
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:54,490
Let me show you another kind of martial arts.

79
00:12:05,820 --> 00:12:07,180
Poor thing.

80
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:09,960
You saw the dead Zhaoxing.

81
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:12,100
The dead god has betrayed you.

82
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:14,420
Run! Run!

83
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:27,740
You can't run away.

84
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,460
Hurry up!

85
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:31,020
Give me a chance.

86
00:12:31,300 --> 00:12:34,980
I'll show you the fear of the dead god.

87
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:45,820
My whole body has been electrocuted.

88
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,780
The invisible technique.

89
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:14,810
Zhaoxing, you can't use it anymore.

90
00:13:14,890 --> 00:14:30,520
Zhaoxing, you can't use it anymore.

91
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:32,880
My whole body has been electrocuted.

92
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:34,760
Why?

93
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,180
When he was about to use the white sand,

94
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:40,840
the witch took advantage of it

95
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:44,800
and used his blood to dye the white sand red.

96
00:14:55,690 --> 00:14:56,210
Why?

97
00:14:57,610 --> 00:14:58,450
Why?

98
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:01,770
Li Wei.

99
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:15,980
You used your blood to wash him.

100
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,020
I want you to die.

101
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:27,680
Do you want to see me?

102
00:15:55,360 --> 00:16:07,090
You can't run away.

103
00:16:07,570 --> 00:16:08,210
Help!

104
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:20,240
Tear him into pieces.

105
00:16:29,070 --> 00:16:30,490
There's a fire in that sword.

106
00:16:31,070 --> 00:16:31,690
If you take another five steps,

107
00:16:31,890 --> 00:16:32,830
you'll get a heart attack.

108
00:16:33,190 --> 00:16:33,750
There's no cure.

109
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:35,530
If you don't believe me, try it.

110
00:16:36,690 --> 00:16:37,610
Nonsense.

111
00:16:37,610 --> 00:16:42,790
I don't believe there's such a poison.

112
00:16:46,890 --> 00:16:55,880
Your body has been electrocuted.

113
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:56,880
Let go of my sword.

114
00:16:57,660 --> 00:16:58,320
Let go!

115
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:05,360
I can't stand it anymore.

116
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,300
It's just one step.

117
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:07,640
Take four more steps.

118
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:23,260
Catch Li's wife for me.

119
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:28,300
I'll let go of your sister.

120
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:30,700
No, let my sister go.

121
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,160
No.

122
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:37,100
I'll give you one hour.

123
00:17:38,580 --> 00:17:42,020
If you don't catch Li's wife,

124
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,800
I'll die with your sister.

125
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:51,620
Okay, wait for me here.

126
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,320
I'll be right back.

127
00:19:39,010 --> 00:19:40,590
Look at you.

128
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:42,370
You don't look like a bad guy.

129
00:19:43,710 --> 00:19:44,510
Tell me.

130
00:19:45,090 --> 00:19:46,430
Why did you kill Li?

131
00:19:47,250 --> 00:19:48,490
To save my sister.

132
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:50,110
I had no other choice.

133
00:19:55,340 --> 00:19:56,060
What do we do now?

134
00:19:58,760 --> 00:19:59,580
Help him up.

135
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:16,280
The master's order.

136
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:17,140
You have to leave.

137
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,760
Since you have a heart,

138
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:23,700
please go back and report to the master.

139
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:26,960
You report to the master,

140
00:20:27,900 --> 00:20:30,140
but I'm dead.

141
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:32,040
You don't want to?

142
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:35,180
No, I don't want to.

143
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,760
I don't believe you.

144
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:40,240
We're really Jin Da Qiong's men.

145
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:43,100
You have to believe us.

146
00:20:43,740 --> 00:20:46,740
I don't believe in your abilities.

147
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:54,320
Besides, I have to wait for someone.

148
00:20:54,740 --> 00:20:57,880
If I don't come back in 15 minutes,

149
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:01,080
you're dead.

150
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,000
I've got the man you wanted.

151
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:18,300
Hurry up.

152
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:21,160
Get that woman out of the carriage.

153
00:21:23,700 --> 00:21:26,140
Hurry up.

154
00:21:26,140 --> 00:21:27,300
What are you waiting for?

155
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,700
Get her out of the carriage.

156
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:46,510
There's a woman inside.

157
00:21:47,150 --> 00:21:48,790
No wonder she hasn't come out for a long time.

158
00:21:49,650 --> 00:22:10,220
You have to realize today

159
00:22:10,220 --> 00:22:13,960
that I was cunning

160
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:16,280
to let you win.

161
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:17,820
Get that woman out of the carriage.

162
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:21,780
Although you have super powers,

163
00:22:23,020 --> 00:22:25,780
it's only a matter of time.

164
00:22:27,340 --> 00:22:29,620
The Seven Stars Spring has a history of 2,000 years.

165
00:22:30,740 --> 00:22:32,500
What's left in the body is blood of justice.

166
00:22:33,460 --> 00:22:35,580
The Seven Stars Spring is empty.

167
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:06,610
Greetings, Master.

168
00:23:08,130 --> 00:23:08,910
It's been a long time.

169
00:23:10,670 --> 00:23:12,670
Get the two of you out of the carriage.

170
00:23:12,810 --> 00:23:13,690
Bring back a few more people.

171
00:23:16,350 --> 00:23:24,220
Yes, Master.

172
00:23:27,660 --> 00:23:31,020
Brother Jin, you have to vent your anger on me.

173
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:34,720
I'll do whatever I can for Shan Cha.

174
00:23:35,140 --> 00:23:35,920
You're too guilty.

175
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:38,960
Shan Cha is my love.

176
00:23:39,500 --> 00:23:40,560
I want to save him.

177
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:42,040
Don't bother.

178
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,860
You need to rest.

179
00:23:43,860 --> 00:23:45,060
You can't go out.

180
00:23:45,980 --> 00:23:46,440
Guards!

181
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:47,500
Yes, sir.

182
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:48,280
Take a rest.

183
00:23:48,860 --> 00:23:49,620
No.

184
00:23:57,680 --> 00:24:00,760
No one can trap me in this world.

185
00:25:09,470 --> 00:26:07,050
Thank goodness we ran so fast.

186
00:26:07,750 --> 00:26:08,370
I was scared to death.

187
00:26:09,330 --> 00:26:10,490
Let's go.

188
00:26:11,090 --> 00:26:11,870
I'm exhausted.

189
00:26:14,530 --> 00:26:15,790
Let's sit here for a while.

190
00:26:15,790 --> 00:26:17,470
Take a good rest.

191
00:26:59,380 --> 00:26:59,860
Ming!

192
00:27:02,420 --> 00:27:04,400
Aren't you Ming?

193
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:05,100
Wait!

194
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:07,520
What?

195
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,180
Be brave.

196
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:09,580
Please let us in.

197
00:27:10,280 --> 00:27:12,080
Yes, let us in.

198
00:27:14,760 --> 00:27:15,340
Okay?

199
00:27:15,820 --> 00:27:16,560
Tell us.

200
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:17,360
Yes.

201
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:20,160
If you don't want to learn martial arts,

202
00:27:20,460 --> 00:27:22,160
you have to find my master, Brother Li.

203
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:23,740
Will he teach us?

204
00:27:23,980 --> 00:27:25,880
What if he doesn't?

205
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,500
Don't worry.

206
00:27:26,780 --> 00:27:27,860
I'll take care of everything.

207
00:27:28,380 --> 00:27:29,480
Come with me.

208
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:58,040
Please forgive my brother.

209
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,920
He didn't do it on purpose.

210
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:01,300
Ming!

211
00:28:02,540 --> 00:28:03,260
Brother!

212
00:28:03,260 --> 00:28:03,900
What do we do?

213
00:28:09,040 --> 00:28:10,060
Brother Li!

214
00:28:13,340 --> 00:28:14,520
Sister!

215
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:18,100
Sister!

216
00:28:18,100 --> 00:28:18,260
You Li!

217
00:28:27,810 --> 00:28:29,480
His condition is getting worse.

218
00:28:29,780 --> 00:28:30,780
Sister!

219
00:28:33,080 --> 00:28:33,880
Sister!

220
00:28:36,260 --> 00:28:36,740
You Li!

221
00:28:39,100 --> 00:28:39,640
Bear with it.

222
00:28:44,590 --> 00:28:45,520
Why are you looking for Brother Li?

223
00:28:46,460 --> 00:28:47,740
Why are you looking for me?

224
00:28:48,780 --> 00:28:51,400
I hate you.

225
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:52,780
I hate you.

226
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:04,100
I hate you so much.

227
00:29:12,580 --> 00:29:14,600
You made me fall into the abyss of pain.

228
00:30:32,330 --> 00:30:32,650
Brother Li!

229
00:30:33,370 --> 00:30:33,990
Let's go!

230
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:48,320
This is the time to learn martial arts.

231
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,260
This is not the time to learn martial arts.

232
00:30:52,280 --> 00:30:53,040
Brother Li!

233
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,340
Brother Li!

234
00:30:54,340 --> 00:30:55,900
Please accept us as your disciples.

235
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:58,300
We sincerely worship you as our master.

236
00:30:58,940 --> 00:30:59,560
Yes.

237
00:30:59,660 --> 00:31:00,560
Please accept us as your disciples.

238
00:31:00,580 --> 00:31:01,540
Please, Brother Li.

239
00:31:06,990 --> 00:31:09,190
Learning martial arts is only for one person.

240
00:31:10,230 --> 00:31:12,570
Learning martial arts is for thousands of people.

241
00:31:13,970 --> 00:31:14,590
Tell us.

242
00:31:15,070 --> 00:31:18,190
Is it for one person or for thousands of people?

243
00:31:19,110 --> 00:31:20,790
Brother Li, please give me some face.

244
00:31:21,730 --> 00:31:23,390
Brother An, what should we do?

245
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,480
It's not Brother An.

246
00:31:37,480 --> 00:31:38,900
This is the best way.

247
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,580
Yes, it is.

248
00:31:44,680 --> 00:32:26,170
What are you doing?

249
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:27,730
Do you know how to do it?

250
00:32:27,990 --> 00:32:30,390
Not only do I know how to do it, I'm going to kill you guys.

251
00:32:39,420 --> 00:32:41,260
I'm going to kill you!

252
00:32:41,900 --> 00:32:43,960
Don't underestimate me!

253
00:33:06,500 --> 00:33:07,860
Not me!

254
00:33:07,980 --> 00:33:09,040
Why are you so stupid?

255
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:57,090
I want you to take a bath in the water.

256
00:35:23,670 --> 00:35:25,390
Help! Help!

257
00:35:41,890 --> 00:35:44,050
Why did you leave the explosives here?

258
00:35:44,330 --> 00:35:45,550
I'm not that stupid.

259
00:35:45,990 --> 00:35:48,390
I wanted to save you and all the children.

260
00:35:49,070 --> 00:35:50,090
I wanted to avoid violence.

261
00:35:51,090 --> 00:35:52,930
I didn't expect to be caught by him

262
00:35:52,930 --> 00:35:54,490
and leave the explosives here.

263
00:35:56,010 --> 00:35:59,330
I didn't expect you to be so brave at such a young age.

264
00:35:59,710 --> 00:36:00,970
What about the other children?

265
00:36:01,470 --> 00:36:02,650
They're safe in Shandong.

266
00:36:05,810 --> 00:36:07,310
Don't be angry.

267
00:36:08,390 --> 00:36:09,230
I didn't kill them.

268
00:36:12,750 --> 00:36:15,650
Just you wait.

269
00:36:33,350 --> 00:36:36,590
Shan Cha, get up and take revenge.

270
00:36:38,070 --> 00:36:39,470
Shan Cha, you can't die.

271
00:36:40,170 --> 00:36:42,170
I'm used to being sad

272
00:36:42,170 --> 00:36:44,930
but I'm still afraid of being alone.

273
00:36:45,930 --> 00:36:49,690
Shan Cha, get up.

274
00:36:56,780 --> 00:36:58,940
Jin, he's your brother.

275
00:36:59,520 --> 00:37:00,480
You can't even save him.

276
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:02,660
Are you kidding me?

277
00:37:06,770 --> 00:37:07,670
He's him.

278
00:37:08,450 --> 00:37:09,550
I'm me.

279
00:37:10,850 --> 00:37:14,350
Sometimes it's easier to survive

280
00:37:15,690 --> 00:37:17,970
You didn't save him on purpose.

281
00:37:17,970 --> 00:37:19,470
You wanted to get me, didn't you?

282
00:37:21,990 --> 00:37:23,110
Are you trying to kill me?

283
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:27,870
You...

284
00:37:42,290 --> 00:37:44,790
No, I don't want to.

